png_safecat` message, OR `PNG_IMAGE_ERROR`, `png_image_free(image)`, `return 0`. Used for all the argument-validation failures enumerated above.\n\nBoth `png_safe_error`/`png_safe_execute` are compiled under `#if defined(PNG_SIMPLIFIED_READ_SUPPORTED) || defined(PNG_SIMPLIFIED_WRITE_SUPPORTED)` (`src/pngerror.c:757-758`) with the note at `:759-762` that the mechanism currently requires `SETJMP_SUPPORTED`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1481,"cache_read_input_tokens":124485,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1481,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01PD8gfMGbFZiEYsNEfwTNqf","session_id":"e3091878-9949-4689-ad83-c0c41e6641a2","uuid":"fae383af-bb35-44d9-97d9-51c0d0d946ca","timestamp":"2026-08-31T13:26:07.979Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Map progressive read + simplified API"}
